  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:24.690" end="00:27.766" ttm:agent="v1">If you want problems bitch don't hold up let's get straight to it</p>
      <p begin="00:27.766" end="00:30.727" ttm:agent="v1">My bullets fly just like a white dad on a lake shootin'</p>
      <p begin="00:30.727" end="00:33.827" ttm:agent="v1">The west side where I'm from n'where the gang movin'</p>
      <p begin="00:33.827" end="00:37.113" ttm:agent="v1">This mf wanna test me but he straight stupid</p>
      <p begin="00:37.113" end="00:38.613" ttm:agent="v1">B1tch I like to get it on</p>
      <p begin="00:38.494" end="00:39.994" ttm:agent="v1">Sittin' on a million</p>
      <p begin="00:39.722" end="00:43.170" ttm:agent="v1">If I killed myself back then I probably wouldn't of made it on</p>
      <p begin="00:43.170" end="00:44.693" ttm:agent="v1">B1tch I like to keep the chrome</p>
      <p begin="00:44.693" end="00:46.239" ttm:agent="v1">Book it like I see the police</p>
      <p begin="00:46.239" end="00:50.104" ttm:agent="v1">This is owned granite counters I ain't paying no lease</p>
      <p begin="00:50.104" end="00:51.604" ttm:agent="v1">Like what's your problem b1tch?</p>
      <p begin="00:51.175" end="00:52.675" ttm:agent="v1">I'm smoking out the fifth</p>
      <p begin="00:52.616" end="00:55.632" ttm:agent="v1">I got this brand new ****ing. 40 box is full of tips</p>
      <p begin="00:55.632" end="00:57.194" ttm:agent="v1">I'm indecisive shit</p>
      <p begin="00:57.194" end="00:58.781" ttm:agent="v1">The-The beamer or the vet</p>
      <p begin="00:58.781" end="01:00.281" ttm:agent="v1">I'm on the road</p>
      <p begin="01:00.015" end="01:01.634" ttm:agent="v1">Sippin' on dirty 4s</p>
      <p begin="01:01.634" end="01:03.134" ttm:agent="v1">You sippin' on counterfeit</p>
      <p begin="01:02.748" end="01:04.248" ttm:agent="v1">Lil' b1tch I'm on one</p>
      <p begin="01:03.763" end="01:05.263" ttm:agent="v1">Look at my mf crib</p>
      <p begin="01:04.664" end="01:06.164" ttm:agent="v1">Look at my mf face</p>
      <p begin="01:05.867" end="01:07.367" ttm:agent="v1">Looking at all of the chips</p>
      <p begin="01:06.958" end="01:08.766" ttm:agent="v1">I front to a b1tch I don't got no mf cake</p>
      <p begin="01:08.766" end="01:10.585" ttm:agent="v1">I been to LA</p>
      <p begin="01:10.585" end="01:12.191" ttm:agent="v1">I been drivin' whips that spin with stars in the wraith</p>
      <p begin="01:12.191" end="01:13.691" ttm:agent="v1">You famine n' fake</p>
      <p begin="01:13.665" end="01:15.213" ttm:agent="v1">Lil boy I just bagged yo b1tch n' told her to stay</p>
      <p begin="01:15.213" end="01:17.060" ttm:agent="v1">Just the other day</p>
      <p begin="01:17.060" end="01:18.560" ttm:agent="v1">Looking at the money in the bank</p>
      <p begin="01:17.846" end="01:19.346" ttm:agent="v1">What it say?</p>
      <p begin="01:19.006" end="01:22.261" ttm:agent="v1">A mil that I've been sittin' on accountant need a break</p>
      <p begin="01:22.261" end="01:24.559" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, I need a break, need a break</p>
      <p begin="01:24.559" end="01:27.668" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, I need a break</p>
      <p begin="01:27.668" end="01:30.837" ttm:agent="v1">If you want problems b1tch don't hold up let's get straight to it</p>
      <p begin="01:30.837" end="01:33.462" ttm:agent="v1">My bullets fly just like a white dad on a lake shootin'</p>
      <p begin="01:33.462" end="01:36.458" ttm:agent="v1">The west side where I'm from n'where the gang movin'</p>
      <p begin="01:36.458" end="01:39.642" ttm:agent="v1">This mf wanna test me but he straight stupid</p>
      <p begin="01:39.642" end="01:41.180" ttm:agent="v1">B1tch I like to get it on</p>
      <p begin="01:41.180" end="01:42.680" ttm:agent="v1">Sittin' on a million</p>
      <p begin="01:42.583" end="01:45.824" ttm:agent="v1">If I killed myself back then I probably wouldn't of made it on</p>
      <p begin="01:45.824" end="01:47.387" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch I like to keep the chrome</p>
      <p begin="01:47.387" end="01:48.961" ttm:agent="v1">Book it like I see the police</p>
      <p begin="01:48.961" end="01:52.961" ttm:agent="v1">This is owned granite counters I ain't paying no lease</p>
    </div>
